# Scoreline's demo (scoreline/app/) is a single-page app: a reload on one of its screens
# (scoreline/app/match/1/facts) gets the app page (the target is the folder, not index.html: Cloudflare rejects a rule that ends in index.html).
# Only the app's own routes are listed: Cloudflare Pages applies a rule even when a file exists at that path,
# so a catch-all on scoreline/app/* would answer the app's scripts, .riv and images with the page too.
/scoreline/app/match/*   /scoreline/app/  200
/scoreline/app/player/*  /scoreline/app/  200
/scoreline/app/dev/*     /scoreline/app/  200
